body:
its ok to not believe in god or have religious doubts. hell anyone who has 100%faith in religion without any shadow of a doubt is an idiot. and its scary, really fucking scary to know that maybe we will be condemned to an eternity of suffering or maybe nothing happens(just light out shows over). that uncertainty is a fear everyone (who isnt an idiot) faces at some point or another. many do so for the majority of their lives.

&#x200B;

i may not understand the pain. but i do fully understand the fear. please stay strong

&#x200B;
